<title>USA: FCOJ weekly movement rises to 4.911 mln gallons.</title>
<headline>FCOJ weekly movement rises to 4.911 mln gallons.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Citrus Processors Association said frozen concentrated orange juice movement into trade channels for the week ended May 17 was 4,911,368 gallons compared with 4,659,784 gallons last week.</p>
<p>Imports were 174,248 gallons compared with 277,495 gallons the previous week.  There were 26,321 domestic receipts for this week compared with 132,864 the previous week.</p>
<p>Retail movement was 621,810 gallons, while bulk movement was 501,720 gallons.</p>
<p>Current season cumulative movement was 126,012,616 gallons.</p>
<p>Inventory was 167,012,616 gallons.</p>
<p>The final total pack for the season is 222,663,714 gallons.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
